# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of TimeOff operations: /api/docs (tag "TimeOff").

### GET /api/timeoff/types — ?all=1 adds inactive types (admins only)
GET {{host}}/api/timeoff/types
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/timeoff/types — timeoff.types.store
POST {{host}}/api/timeoff/types
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Example name",
    "code": "Example code"
}

